			<item>
				<title>Apache htaccess: Force Domain HTTPS/SSL protocol</title>
				<link>https://wlsc.de/posts/2016-06-13-apache-htaccess-force-domain-httpsssl-protocol/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 13 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://wlsc.de/posts/2016-06-13-apache-htaccess-force-domain-httpsssl-protocol/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;In order to redirect all users from the unsecure HTTP to the &lt;strong&gt;secure HTTPS&lt;/strong&gt; connection, you need to edit your *&#xA;&lt;em&gt;.htaccess&lt;/em&gt;* file. Usually, it is located in the root of your project (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;httpdocs&lt;/strong&gt; folder).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-apache&#34; data-lang=&#34;apache&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;IfModule&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;mod_rewrite.c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;RewriteEngine &lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;On&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;RewriteCond %{HTTPS} !=on&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://%{HTTP_HOST}/$1 [R=301,L]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;lt;/IfModule&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Short URL in your GWT project</title>
				<link>https://wlsc.de/posts/2016-04-21-short-url-in-your-gwt-project/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 21 Apr 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://wlsc.de/posts/2016-04-21-short-url-in-your-gwt-project/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;If you are struggling with a long URL in the GWT project, you are at the right place! There is a small trick, which&#xA;allows URL to be shorter.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;url-transformation&#34;&gt;&#xA;  URL Transformation&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#url-transformation&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;https://domain.com/tomcat_context_path/project_name/your_index.html&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;https://domain.com/tomcat_context_path/&#xA;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description>
			</item>
